# ── Shareholder material ──
# The deck and its generator carry the cap table, the ESOP pool, named
# shareholders and an individual's salary terms. None of it is needed to
# build or run the product, and a code repository is read by contractors,
# agencies and future hires — so it lives outside git. Keep the files; they
# are simply not this repository's business.
docs/shareholder-deck.pptx
scripts/shareholder-deck.js

# The standalone design bundle: one 4.9 MB HTML file with every font and
# photograph inlined. Git keeps every version of it forever, and the two
# files beside it — the README and the .dc.html prototype — already carry
# the design. Regenerate it from those if it is ever needed again.
One Interiors design system (1)/design_handoff_landing_page/One Interiors - Landing Page.html
